#: Game/Levels/TutorialWorld/Level05.lean:7
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"If we have some object or function with some definition, §0 will rewrite the object\n"
"with its definition in the goal. Lean often unfolds terms automatically, but some tactics and definitions\n"
"are not unfolded automatically. The §1 tactic also helps make it easier to take the next steps.\n"
"\n"
"§2 unfolds at the assumption §3 whereas §4 unfolds everywhere.\n"
"\n"
"## Example:\n"
"\n"
"If you have a goal §5, with §6 (\\\\\"Not\\\\\" P) being defined as §7,\n"
"using §8 will change the goal to §9"
msgstr ""

