#: Game/Levels/TutorialWorld/Level06.lean:7
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"If §0 is a proof (for example a hypothesis), then §1 will break the\n"
"proof up into the pieces used to prove it.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If §2 is a hypothesis, then §3 will turn one goal\n"
"into two goals, one with a hypothesis §4 and the other with a\n"
"hypothesis §5.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If §6 is a hypothesis, then §7 will turn one goal into no goals,\n"
"because there are no ways to make a proof of §8! And if you have no goals left,\n"
"you have finished the level.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If §9 is a hypothesis, then §10 will create a variable\n"
"§11 and a hypothesis §12"
msgstr ""

