#: Game/Levels/TutorialWorld/Level10.lean:7
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"If §0 is an object, and the goal mentions §1, then §2\n"
"attempts to prove the goal by induction on §3, with the base case being §4\n"
"and the inductive case being §5 with hypothesis §6.\n"
"\n"
"### Example:\n"
"If the goal is\n"
"§7\n"
"\n"
"then\n"
"\n"
"§8\n"
"\n"
"will turn it into two goals. The first is §9;\n"
"the second has an assumption §10 and goal\n"
"§11.\n"
"\n"
"Note that you must prove the first\n"
"goal before you can access the second one."
msgstr ""

