#: Game/Levels/TutorialWorld/Level03.lean:7
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"Intro introduces a new hypothesis and changes your goal. If you have a goal of the form §0,\n"
"§1 will change the goal to §2 and create a new hypothesis §3.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is §4, §5 will create the hypothesis §6, and change the\n"
"goal to §7.\n"
"\n"
"## Other usage\n"
"\n"
"The §8 tactic also works with goals using §9 (\"for all\"). If your goal is of the form §10,\n"
"§11 will create a new variable §12, and change the goal to §13.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is §14, §15 will create a variable §16, and change the goal\n"
"to §17."
msgstr ""

