#: Game/Levels/TutorialWorld/Level04.lean:8
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"The constructor tactic splits the goal into multiple parts. This is helpful for goals that are\n"
"difficult to solve all at once, like \"and\" (§0) and \"if and only if\" (§1).\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If we have the goal §2, §3 will change the goal into two goals: §4 and §5.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If we have the goal§6, §7 will change the goal into two goals: §8, and §9."
msgstr ""

