#: Game/Levels/TutorialWorld/Level05.lean:50
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"§0 acts very similar to the §1 tactic, except it allows you to introduce many new\n"
"hypotheses/variables at once. §2 essentially acts as §3.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is §4, §5 will create hypotheses §6,\n"
"§7, §8, and a variable §9, and change the goal to §10."
msgstr ""

