#. split
#. case pos =>
#.   -- Prove the case when condition is true
#.   sorry
#. case neg =>
#.   -- Prove the case when condition is false
#.   sorry
#. ```
#: Game/Levels/InnerProductWorld/Level01.lean:151
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"§0 allows you to prove different cases of a goal separately. Often appears after using tactics like §1 or §2.\n"
"\n"
"## Syntax\n"
"\n"
"- §3 - Proves the positive case\n"
"- §4 - Proves the negative case\n"
"- §5 - Proves the case with the given tag\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"After §6 on an if-then-else:\n"
"§7"
msgstr ""

