#: Game/Levels/LinearIndependenceSpanWorld/Level08.lean:38
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"§0 allows you to reduce the goal to a simpler statement. It's useful when proving §1\n"
"makes it easy to prove your original goal §2.\n"
"\n"
"## Syntax\n"
"\n"
"- §3 - Creates a new goal §4, and after proving it, you get §5 to prove the original goal\n"
"- §6 - Proves the original goal using §7 immediately\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is §8 and you know this follows from §9 and §10, you can write:\n"
"§11\n"
"\n"
"## Common usage\n"
"\n"
"Often used when the goal follows easily from a simpler fact, especially in contradiction proofs."
msgstr ""

