#: Game/Levels/TutorialWorld/Level06.lean:34
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"§0 changes any goal to §1 this works because proving §2 is a contradiction and can\n"
"thus prove anything else. Mathematically, this means that for any proposition §3, §4.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If you have a hypothesis §5, and a goal §6, §7 will solve the goal`"
