#: Game/Levels/TutorialWorld/Level05.lean:63
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"§0 is the logical negation. In Lean, §1 is defined as §2.\n"
"When you see §3 in a goal or hypothesis, you can use §4 to\n"
"replace it with §5.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If you have a goal §6, using §7 will change it to §8.\n"
"This often makes it easier to work with using §9 and other tactics."
msgstr ""

