#: Game/Levels/LinearMapsWorld/Level01.lean:81
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"§0 lets you explicitly state what you're trying to prove. It helps clarify complex goals.\n"
"\n"
"## Syntax\n"
"\n"
"§1 where §2 is the statement you want to prove\n"
