"The §5 tactic is very important in Lean. It allows you to split any object or hypothesis into\n"
"cases. In this level, we will eventually have an and statement as a hypothesis. If we have §6,\n"
"§7 will create two hypotheses: §8, and §9. If you have an object §10 that\n"
