"### Exfalso\n"
"The §15 tactic is also useful in this level. It simply changes the goal to §16. This works\n"
"because if you can prove §17, you have a contradiction, and can thus prove any statements. For\n"
"example, if you have a hypothesis §18, and a goal §19, §20 will solve the goal.\n"
"\n"
